<!-- ABSTRACT -->
<!-- ============================================================ -->
<div class="page-break"></div>
<h1>ABSTRACT</h1>
<p>FeeFlow is a web-based school fee management system designed to digitize and streamline the financial operations of educational institutions. The system addresses the critical challenges faced by schools in managing student fee records, tracking payments, generating receipts, and handling appointment scheduling. Traditional manual methods of fee management are prone to errors, time-consuming, and lack transparency, leading to disputes and inefficiencies in financial administration.</p>
<p>The system is built using PHP, MySQL, HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript, with Firebase integration for real-time notifications and data synchronization. It features two main user interfaces: an administrative panel for school staff to manage students, monitor payments, and generate financial reports; and a student portal for learners to view their fee status, make online payments, book appointments, and track payment plans.</p>
<p>Key functionalities include online payment processing through multiple channels (Mobile Money, Credit/Debit Cards, Bank Transfers, USSD, QR Code, and Auto-Pay), a digital appointment booking system, a live queue monitoring system, payment plan management with flexible installment options, automated payment reminders, and comprehensive analytics dashboards. The system supports dual database architecture with MySQL for transactional data and Firebase Firestore for real-time features.</p>
<p>Testing and validation were conducted using a seed dataset of 16 students across 8 class levels (Nursery through Primary 7) with various fee types including Tuition, Development, Sports, Library, and School Meals fees. The system achieved reliable performance in processing payments, booking appointments, and generating reports. FeeFlow presents a scalable, secure, and user-friendly solution for modern school fee management needs.</p>
<p><b>Keywords:</b> Fee management, school finance, online payments, PHP, MySQL, Firebase, appointment booking, queue management</p>

