<h2>7.4 Integration Testing</h2>

<h3>7.4.1 Admin Dashboard Integration</h3>
<p><b>Scenario:</b> Admin logs in, views dashboard, navigates to student list</p>
<table>
<tr><th>Step</th><th>Action</th><th>Expected Result</th><th>Status</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td>Navigate to admin/login.php</td><td>Login form displayed</td><td>PASS</td></tr>
