<h2>B.4 Setup Instructions</h2>
<ol>
<li><b>Install XAMPP:</b> Download and install XAMPP from https://www.apachefriends.org/</li>
<li><b>Start Services:</b> Launch XAMPP Control Panel and start Apache and MySQL services.</li>
<li><b>Create Database:</b> Open phpMyAdmin (http://localhost/phpmyadmin) and create database "student_fees_db".</li>
<li><b>Run Migration:</b> Browse to http://localhost/fee-management/migrate_schema.php to create tables and default admin account.</li>
<li><b>Seed Data:</b> Import school_students.sql via phpMyAdmin or run the provided SQL script.</li>
<li><b>Firebase Setup:</b> Create a Firebase project, enable Firestore, and update firebase-config.js with your project credentials.</li>
<li><b>Access System:</b> Browse to http://localhost/fee-management/ to access the system.</li>
</ol>

<h2>B.5 Admin User Guide</h2>
<p><b>Managing Students:</b></p>
<ol>
<li>Log in to the admin panel with admin credentials.</li>
<li>Click "Manage Students" in the sidebar to view the student registry.</li>
<li>Use the search box to find students by name, ID, or email.</li>
<li>Use dropdown filters to narrow by class, gender, or status.</li>
<li>Click "View" to open a student's dashboard in a new tab.</li>
<li>Click "Remind" to send payment reminders.</li>
<li>Click "Delete" to remove a student record (with confirmation).</li>
<li>Click "Export CSV" to download filtered student data.</li>
</ol>

<p><b>Monitoring Payments:</b></p>
<ol>
<li>Click "Online Payments" to view all digital payment transactions.</li>
<li>Use filter tabs (All, Today, Pending, Completed) to narrow the view.</li>
<li>Review transaction details including amount, method, and status.</li>
<li>Verify pending payments using the "Verify" button.</li>
</ol>

<p><b>Viewing Analytics:</b></p>
<ol>
<li>Click "Payment Analytics" to access the comprehensive analytics dashboard.</li>
<li>Review KPI cards for total collections, outstanding balance, and recovery rate.</li>
<li>View collection breakdown by fee type with visual progress bars.</li>
<li>Review payment method distribution.</li>
<li>Identify top students with outstanding balances.</li>
<li>Generate reports using the export buttons.</li>
</ol>

<h2>B.6 Student User Guide</h2>
<p><b>Viewing Dashboard:</b></p>
<ol>
<li>Access the student dashboard with your student ID: dashboard.php?sim_id=S101.</li>
<li>Review the welcome banner, fee summary, and payment history.</li>
<li>Check the fee breakdown sidebar for individual fee item status.</li>
<li>View real-time notifications in the notifications panel.</li>
<li>Click "My Profile" to view detailed student information.</li>
</ol>

<p><b>Making a Payment:</b></p>
<ol>
<li>Click "Payment Gateway" or "Skip the Line" from the dashboard.</li>
<li>Review outstanding fees and total amount due.</li>
<li>Select a payment method: Credit Card, Mobile Money, or Bank Transfer.</li>
<li>Fill in the required payment details.</li>
<li>Click the payment button to submit.</li>
<li>View and print the payment receipt from the confirmation page.</li>
</ol>

<p><b>Booking an Appointment:</b></p>
<ol>
<li>Click "Book Appointment" from the dashboard.</li>
<li>Review upcoming appointments in the sidebar.</li>
<li>Select a date (must be between tomorrow and 30 days from now).</li>
<li>Click an available time slot from the grid.</li>
<li>Select the purpose of your visit from the dropdown.</li>
<li>Add optional notes.</li>
<li>Click "Book Appointment" to confirm.</li>
</ol>

<p><b>Checking Queue Status:</b></p>
<ol>
<li>Click "Queue" from the student navigation menu.</li>
<li>View the currently serving token number and counter.</li>
<li>Check the estimated wait time based on queue position.</li>
<li>View the full queue list to see all waiting students.</li>
</ol>

